    {
        "content": "<p>The pointwise operations on sets are defined in <a href=\"https://tqft.net/mathlib4files/Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Pointwise/Set/Basic\">file#Mathlib/Algebra/Group/Pointwise/Set/Basic</a> (thanks Chris). The instances are not in scope by default, you need <code>open scoped Pointwise</code> so that they are in scope.</p>",
